    "UDP has no authentication: anyone who can reach this port can fake the ready status. Enter the device's IP so packets from other senders are only counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UDP 沒有驗證，任何能送到這個連接埠的人都能偽造就緒狀態。請填入裝置的 IP，其他來源的封包只計數、不處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
